    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/c48daf3dc032832ed965c583a9b58cb6.avif?t=1754651651\" data-has-big width=800 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are participant in mysterious game show. Your hosts want you to entertain the audience, and how can you entertain anyone without risking your life? That's right - you can't!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive experience:</strong>\u00a0Atmospheric liminal environment. No cutscenes or other ways to take controls away from you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror:</strong> PTSD, phobias will never let you go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some stories based on real events: </strong>Human cruelty has no limits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpunk setting:\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interesting plot:\u00a0The plot will evolve with each level.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Episodes - 4 Trials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot Episode: Magic Quiz Lottery -\u00a0</strong><i>&quot;Answer questions and win the prizes&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/557cd91ee66e6ee79d0d6cc40d9620a5.poster.avif?t=1754651651\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/557cd91ee66e6ee79d0d6cc40d9620a5.webm?t=1754651651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/557cd91ee66e6ee79d0d6cc40d9620a5.mp4?t=1754651651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 2: Rock Paper Scissors - </strong><i>&quot;Paper beats rock. Money beats pain.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/140f17701a998b02928cce0aa2a3db46.poster.avif?t=1754651651\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/140f17701a998b02928cce0aa2a3db46.webm?t=1754651651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/140f17701a998b02928cce0aa2a3db46.mp4?t=1754651651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/c48daf3dc032832ed965c583a9b58cb6.avif?t=1754651651\" data-has-big width=800 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are participant in mysterious game show. Your hosts want you to entertain the audience, and how can you entertain anyone without risking your life? That's right - you can't!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive experience:</strong>\u00a0Atmospheric liminal environment. No cutscenes or other ways to take controls away from you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror:</strong> PTSD, phobias will never let you go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some stories based on real events: </strong>Human cruelty has no limits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpunk setting:\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interesting plot:\u00a0The plot will evolve with each level.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Episodes - 4 Trials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot Episode: Magic Quiz Lottery -\u00a0</strong><i>&quot;Answer questions and win the prizes&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/557cd91ee66e6ee79d0d6cc40d9620a5.poster.avif?t=1754651651\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/557cd91ee66e6ee79d0d6cc40d9620a5.webm?t=1754651651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/557cd91ee66e6ee79d0d6cc40d9620a5.mp4?t=1754651651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 2: Rock Paper Scissors - </strong><i>&quot;Paper beats rock. Money beats pain.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/140f17701a998b02928cce0aa2a3db46.poster.avif?t=1754651651\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/140f17701a998b02928cce0aa2a3db46.webm?t=1754651651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/140f17701a998b02928cce0aa2a3db46.mp4?t=1754651651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Drowning in debt and desperate for a way out, you're invited to a mysterious game show promising untold wealth. But behind the beautiful cover lies a cruel truth: the prize is real \u2014 and so is the price of failure.",
